  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lfu - SSB Food Security statistics 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project goal in the project proposed here is improved food security situation in low- and middle-income countries. The contribution to this is that more statistics is produced from household surveys and used for better policies and implementation of concrete projects.The Norwegian Bureau of statistics will collaborate with COMESA and some national institutions  with a strong element of capacity development. This will include increased knowledge of how to process household budget survey  data so they are accessible to food security indicators and increased knowledge on how to use this data in multiple types of analysis. The support is a part of the Agriculture for development program. Correct data on food security and food consumption is important input for the authorities as well as development partners when assessing if &#x2013; and what sort of interventions should be implemented to avoid or reduce food insecurity.</narrative>
  </description>
